('127.479.d.1.G',3,'Diseases such as measles can spread worldwide, so global vaccination and prevention can help contain:','["costs", "fashion", "warm weather", "tourism"]'::jsonb,0,'Prevention saves money.','original'),
('127.479.d.1.G',4,'Preventing disease with clean water and vaccines is often less expensive than treating the disease, which supports cost:','["spending", "containment", "inflation", "growth"]'::jsonb,1,'Prevention contains costs.','original'),
('127.479.d.2.A',3,'Therapeutic communication involves listening to the patient and responding in a way that is:','["hurried", "rude", "supportive", "careless"]'::jsonb,2,'Supportive responses help patients.','original'),
