('127.479.d.3.A',3,'A supportive relationship can help a person reach career goals by offering:','["encouragement and feedback", "delays", "complaints", "distraction"]'::jsonb,0,'Support promotes growth.','original'),
('127.479.d.3.A',4,'A mentor in the health field can influence career goals by sharing experience and:','["gifts only", "advice", "debts", "rumors"]'::jsonb,1,'Mentors guide.','original'),
('127.479.d.3.B',3,'To build a healthy relationship with a coworker, you should show respect, listen, and be:','["secretive", "late", "reliable", "rude"]'::jsonb,2,'Reliability builds trust.','original'),
('127.479.d.3.B',4,'Thanking a teammate for help and apologizing when you make a mistake are communication skills that maintain a healthy:','["schedule", "bill", "uniform", "relationship"]'::jsonb,3,'Gratitude and apology sustain relationships.','original'),
('127.479.d.3.C',3,'Telling a supervisor, I need help understanding this task, is a healthy way of communicating your:','["needs", "secrets", "weaknesses", "fears only"]'::jsonb,0,'Clear communication of needs.','original'),
('127.479.d.3.C',4,'When angry, a healthy strategy is to pause, breathe, and describe the feeling instead of:','["breathing", "yelling", "listening", "pausing"]'::jsonb,1,'Regulate emotions.','original'),
('127.479.d.3.D',3,'A technique for resolving a conflict is to have each person explain their view and then look for a:','["delay", "winner", "compromise", "punishment"]'::jsonb,2,'Compromise solves conflict.','original'),
